@baseUrl = https://localhost:7217
@sessionId = REPLACE-WITH-FRESH-SESSION-GUID

# ConferenceProFlow M3.4F — restart/catch-up demo (LOCAL DEVELOPMENT ONLY)
# Prerequisite: Complete requests 1-11 of docs/ALLOCATION_E2E.http.
# Replace @sessionId with the NEW session ID from that demo (capacity=2).
# STOP ONLY the Analytics Worker before sending the following requests.
# Keep Registration API, Allocation Worker, Kafka, RabbitMQ, and SQL Server running.
# The session already has 2 confirmed + 1 rejected registrations, so this
# fourth registration should be rejected and become a new Kafka finalization.

### 1. Create a fourth participant, while Analytics Worker is stopped
# @name analyticsRestartCreateParticipant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/participants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Olivia Carter",
  "email": "olivia.carter.analytics.{{$guid}}@example.com"
}

### 2. Register fourth participant for the SAME full session
# @name analyticsRestartCreateRegistration
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantId": "{{analyticsRestartCreateParticipant.response.body.$.id}}",
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}"
}

### 3. Query fourth registration; repeat the GET until final (Rejected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/registrations/{{analyticsRestartCreateRegistration.response.body.$.id}}
